[Music]  have you ever wanted to be  a hulk have you ever wanted to be a  black panther everybody wants to be a  superhero  and that's what realm of champions is  all about it's about  making marvel yours marvel realm of  champions  is a multiplayer you play with your  friends in real time  if you're a marvel fan and you've always  wanted to  create your own marvel character put  your own twist  on it i think you'll want this game  [Music]  the story of realm of champions started  being told like for real in  contest of champions marvel contest of  champions is the first marvel game we  made  uh six years ago and i think gabe always  had  plans for what he was going to do with  the maestro  the maestro is this really evil version  of the hulk  and he wants to become a god essentially  we had reached the end of one storyline  in contest of champions  and it grew into something so expansive  we felt like we needed to make a whole  new game to tell that story  battle world is our entry point into the  game  battle world is a planet that is  composed of a bunch of different  realities that have been brought  together  forcibly by the maestro there's been  many versions of it you know of course  the the original one was from the  original secret wars from 1985.  later we had secret wars 2015 was you  know  it plays with that with the same concept  but it's in a much more  complex way there's 80 plus years of  marvel history  to to pull from for this stuff so where  do you take from  what do you leave for later we really  wanted the world itself to capture the  essence of the characters for example  one of the first ones i worked on was  the house of iron  and we took the idea of tony stark  wanting to protect everyone and build a  suit of armor around the world  so we started with an armored wall and a  shield  and buildings that look like his armor  so the first thing that you're going to  get introduced to is this big  mystery the maestro the god emperor of  better world  the all-powerful you know green emperor  get murdered  you need to find out who killed the  maestro because as evil as he was  he was keeping a lot of things in check  and making sure that  lots of people didn't die but then we  focus into  the center with the eighth houses that  we're going to start the game with the  major houses the house of iron is a  technological utopia  the spider guild in this world they are  traffickers of information  the of hearts they're barbarian hulks oh  the vishanti  uh they are basically a mystic  university that brings together  all the different mystic traditions from  the multiverse  the people of wakanda got exiled so they  have to rebuild the country of wakanda  from scratch the garrison is the moral  guidance of this world  pyramid x its apocalypse kingdom  or the first of our ex-houses so the  asgardian republic  they are our version of the nine realms  first thing you you see  is that start prime proposes that all  the houses  come together and not fight and not go  to war so this is the first stage of  the story this is called the iron age i  don't know about you  but if fighting a secret war will  prevent an open one to a time game  visual customization has always been at  the core of the game  not only are you becoming more powerful  just by leveling up your character but  you're also earning  rare gear with different enhancements on  it  the better your gear the more able  you'll be to compete in  the competitive arena conquest game mode  which will earn you more reputation  with that house that you're trying to  infiltrate and as that  reputation increases again more story  will come to you  from a visual development standpoint  it's been really cool  i sort of get a peek at all of the  concept art that comes in  for these weapons and their their  variants and  the the gear and all the variants and  stuff that's coming down down the line  yeah just like the worlds there's so  much marvel influence  in the gear even for the smallest piece  of gear it would start  with talking to gabe about the narrative  and how it fits into the narrative and  that would inspire the visuals  you want as much variety in the sets as  possible but you also have to be able to  combine them together in a way that  makes sense  for sorcerer supreme we've merged her  design sense with  scarlet witch and you can combine that  with  her voodoo design and her ancient  one-inspired design  so so many different looks but you can  combine them together in a crazy way  there's three sort of core roles to the  game tank characters are really going to  be setting the formation of your team  they're going to be on the front line  engaging  and pulling attention away from weaker  characters like the attack and the  support characters  attack characters are going to hang back  and either jump in and deal sort of  shots of damage  or stay back and and deal damage  consistently from afar  and then support characters also hang  back but their main focus is to debuff  their enemies or buff their allies to  really enhance the abilities of those  other two classes  having those three roles is important to  creating balanced  teams like our vision  has really come together the story the  visuals  and everything works so well together  what you see now in the game  is is just a tiny fraction of what we  have planned there's so much  so many stories that we want to tell  it's really only the beginning and you  can expect  some new story content new game modes  coming soon so  look forward to it  you

